{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07281","headline":"登迁仁楼酬子壻李穆 · 刘长卿","name":"登迁仁楼酬子壻李穆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临风敞丽谯，落日听吹铙。\n归路空回首，新章已在腰。\n非才受官谤，无政作人谣。\n俭岁安三户，余年寄六条。\n春芜生楚国，古树过隋朝。\n赖有东牀客，池塘免寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}